    "text_blocks": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Homeowners insurance in Utah covers a roof leak only if a sudden, accidental event caused the damage."
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "What is Covered"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Storm damage: Heavy wind, hail, or severe downpours."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Falling objects: Trees or large tree limbs crashing onto the roof."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Weight of winter elements: Collapse or strain from heavy ice or accumulated snow."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Interior damage: Resulting water damage to your ceilings or walls if caused by a covered storm peril."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "What is Not Covered"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Wear and tear: Normal aging or materials breaking down over time."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Poor maintenance: Ignored missing shingles, cracked flashing, or clogged gutters."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Gradual leaks: Slow leaks that went unnoticed or unaddressed over long periods."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "If you have questions or a dispute about a denied claim, you can contact the Utah Insurance Department consumer assistance line.",
        "snippet_links": [
          {
            "text": "Utah Insurance Department",
            "link": "https://insurance.utah.gov/consumers/home-insurance/home-claims-info/"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "If you'd like, tell me:"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "What caused the leak (wind, heavy snow, old age)?"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "When did the leak start?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "I can help you figure out your next steps or what to document before calling your insurer."
      },
